      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.BootstrapState.html">BootstrapState</a></h4>
      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.BootstrapState.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Bootstrap state handles initial game setup using constructor injection for all dependencies.
All required services are injected via constructor rather than resolved at runtime.</p>
</section>
