</section>
      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.LoadingState.html">LoadingState</a></h4>
      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.LoadingState.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Loading state that handles different loading scenarios using unified GameSession system
Creates or loads GameSession based on loading configuration
Integrates with TimeService for proper playtime handling</p>
</section>
