      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.MainMenuState.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Main menu state using unified GameSession system for save/load operations</p>
</section>
      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.NewGameState.html">NewGameState</a></h4>
      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.StateMachine.GameStates.NewGameState.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Updated NewGameState that properly initializes the central GameDataManager
